6. Conclusion and Future Work
This paper presents and verifies the 3D Chip Security Logic Lock, fully implementing multi-step physical intercept and audit at the functional simulation level. 35 test cases passed 100%. EPWave waveforms confirmed correct signal timing.

Future work includes: (1) RTL-to-GDSII physical synthesis at advanced process nodes (12nm/3nm); (2) SPICE-level back-gate bias analog circuit design and co-simulation; (3) TSV physical implementation and inter-layer signal integrity analysis; (4) Tapeout verification and pre/post-silicon correlation testing.

